        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi oryarinda obugyenyi bw'Ensiisira, okumara ebiro mushanju, ku oriheza kuhunika eby'aha mbuga yaawe n'eby'omu inyuukiro ryawe; ",
          "type": "text",
