              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Otariita orubanja; otarishoroora omu bantu; kandi otarirya enguzi, ahakuba enguzi eita amaisho g'abanyabwengye, kandi eita emanja z'abahikiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.19",
