              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eby'oburyo, eby'oburyo byonka, obe nibyo waakuratira, obone kugumaho, ohungure ensi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha.",
          "type": "text",
